ic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948790/extras/1df285691298e2b327c10c5ad596fe14.poster.avif?t=1729785196\" width=616 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948790/extras/1df285691298e2b327c10c5ad596fe14.webm?t=1729785196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948790/extras/1df285691298e2b327c10c5ad596fe14.mp4?t=1729785196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Your only option is to push through the sea of bodies, the amalgam of faces, the claustrophobia of the crowd. It could be any of them.<br><br><strong>Whether it's in a subway, nightclub, or riot-filled streets, do what you must to survive.</strong>",
